Attribution for this repository

The files here are a patch applied on top of Framework Computer's QMK firmware
fork. Most of the keyboard definition is not mine.

Original work
-------------
keyboards/framework/macropad/panel_palette.c
keyboards/framework/macropad/keymaps/palette/keymap.c (the changes to it)
keyboards/framework/macropad/rules.mk (the added line)
flash-macropad.py
tests/test_flash_macropad.py
udev/99-framework-macropad-via.rules
the documentation and the images

